{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIAP Fase 4 - Feedback API",
    "description": "Collection for testing FIAP Fase-4 Feedback Platform APIs.\n\nTWO SEPARATE APIs:\n\n1. PUBLIC REST API (no authentication):\n   POST /avaliacao \u2192 Create feedback\n   Endpoint: https://yu74m9aiul.execute-api.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev/avaliacao\n   Request: {\"descricao\": \"...\", \"nota\": 1-10}\n   Response: 201 Created with feedback UUID\n\n2. INTERNAL GRAPHQL API (requires X-API-Key authentication):\n   POST /graphql \u2192 List all feedbacks (internal use only)\n   Endpoint: https://yu74m9aiul.execute-api.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev/graphql\n   Header: X-API-Key: dev-graphql-key-422648464291\n   Request: {\"query\": \"query { listarAvaliacoes { id descricao nota urgencia dataCriacao } }\"}\n   Response: 200 OK with array of feedbacks\n\nVariables: prodUrl, prodGraphqlUrl, prodApiKey, timestamp, feedbackId\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-set timestamp before each request for unique test data",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', Date.now());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
